   "text": "Example\nKarthi:  \"What work is pending for me?\"\nMax:  [Planning] send the price sheet by Friday    [Ads] approve the banner by Monday\nKarthi:  \"only Ads\"\nMax:  now uses only Ads memory (plus Karthi's personal memory)",
   "originalText": "Example\nKarthi:  \"What work is pending for me?\"\nMax:  [Planning] send the price sheet by Friday    [Ads] approve the banner by Monday\nKarthi:  \"only Ads\"\nMax:  now uses only Ads memory (plus Karthi's personal memory)",
